      "content": "Hey, i'm working on some new security SOPs for my boutique hotel. we want to keep things really high-end and quiet, but we've had some issues with different types of crowds coming in and making the lobby feel hectic or unmanaged. can you help me draft a list of guest profiles or types of groups that our security and front desk should keep a closer eye on to ensure they don't disrupt the atmosphere? leaning towards identifying certain behaviors or types of groups that tend to be more high-risk for noise or disturbances.",
